            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[## Smoother editing

- Less repeated notation work when editing dense grooves.
- Worksheet cards and mixer controls refresh when their own settings change, keeping grid editing lighter.
- Better protection for quiet drum and click samples when the audio cache is under pressure.

BeatBake 1.0 (174). Requires Apple silicon and macOS 14 or later.
]]></description>
